observed_and_assumption = "The intents crate builds, but its router test target still uses the removed v6.10 launchpad variants that the follow-up test task owns, and the layerx-agentd dev-dependency does not compile on the integration branch because WaitRequest has no requested_verification_level field. Assumption: the follow-up test task rewrites the router test and the agentd build break is fixed as its own correction, after which this gate is rerun unchanged. Settled at spec 1.0.1: task 2.3.1 do_5 binds the custody-credit reserve of NativeCustodyCredit::new and of the vocabulary test to the treasury module account id and leaves no other reserve account id in the crate; the gate is to be rerun against that text."

