assumption = The views follow the acceptance text (initial margin, 1e18 lot, 0 balance) and the tests assert the same; a spec ruling on each clause decides whether an Order collateral field, a lot unit or a revert is added.

[finding.task-2-2-17-legacy-native-fee-total]
revision = 181a78c43f6d
command = bash tools/release/tests/rollback.test.sh (previous binary set)
exit = 1
log = fleet/logs/fix-8.4.9-translated-validate.log
observed = The previous binary stores a single native protocol_fees_pending record at launchpad key 0x03 that the v6.12.0 keeper reads as a per-token prefix, so paxd export after the upgrade decodes an empty token and panics; MigrateV6120 reads the quote token before readParams and refuses the mainnet params shape (quote_denom, no quote_token).
assumption = The spec names only the FeeAccumulator contract fees; the migration reads params first, deletes the legacy total when it is zero and refuses the upgrade when it is nonzero, and the halt export fixture drops the stale test-chain fee entry so the rehearsal seeds the real zero total. Settled at spec 1.0.1: task 2.0.7 do_4 keeps the singleton protocol_fees_pending record at key 0x03 in the legacy types and task 2.2.17 do_12 carries it into a per-denom pending-protocol-fee record claimable by the treasury under the generation 2 rules, never refused and never deleted, so the delete-when-zero and refuse-when-nonzero path is to be replaced and requalified against that text.

[finding.task-3-2-14-position-modified-equity]
revision = 597df7b67d01
command = go test ./precompiles/perps/ -run 'TestEvent'
exit = 1
log = fleet/logs/requal-3.2.14-verify.log
observed = TestEventPositionModified is the only failing clause: the keeper emits PositionModified with the account equity measured before the fill's trading fee is debited (positions.go emits before the fee step) while the test expects the equity after the fee, 0.222642 USDL lower, and the spec says only "share of account equity".
assumption = The keeper's pre-fee equity stands and the test clause stays as written until a ruling on acceptance 3008.17 fixes the measurement point; every other TestEvent clause including the backstop wiring passes on this revision. Settled at spec 1.0.1: req 3008 ac_17 and acceptance 3.8.17 define newCollateralUsd and newCollateralAmount as the post-fee collateral measured after the fill's trading fee is debited (182,331,858 USDL units in the vector), and task 3.1.9 do_5 emits PositionModified after the fee step; the keeper is to be changed and the gate requalified against that text.

