assumption = "A ruling names the canonical treasury account id (or confirms the layerx-merge retirement), and the task that adds it to layerx-types; 2.3.1 do_5, 2.3.2 do_6 and the other system:paxeer-reserve mentions in the crate (tests/compile.rs, tests/differential.rs, tests/native_custody.rs, vectors/v1.kvx, vectors/v2.kvx) follow it."

